      "opsDirRole": "Operations Director",
      "opsDirDesc": "Manages daily operations, facilities, and administrative functions. Brings 15 years of arts management experience.",
      "eduDir": "Dr. Yuki Tanaka",
      "eduDirRole": "Education Director",
      "eduDirDesc": "Leads curriculum design and teacher training. Holds a PhD in Dance Education and specializes in inclusive dance pedagogy."
